{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"artifacthub/gadgets/audit-seccomp","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:18:34.072Z","source":{"name":"Artifact Hub","api":"https://artifacthub.io/api/v1/packages/inspektor-gadget/gadgets/audit-seccomp","page":"https://artifacthub.io/packages/inspektor-gadget/gadgets/audit-seccomp"},"readme":"# audit_seccomp\n\nThe audit seccomp gadget provides a stream of events with syscalls that had\ntheir seccomp filters generating an audit log. An audit log can be generated in\none of these two conditions:\n\n* The Seccomp profile has the flag `SECCOMP_FILTER_FLAG_LOG` (supported from\n  [runc v1.2.0](https://github.com/opencontainers/runc/releases/tag/v1.2.0),\n  see [runc#3390](https://github.com/opencontainers/runc/pull/3390)) and returns\n  any action other than `SECCOMP_RET_ALLOW`.\n* The Seccomp profile does not have the flag `SECCOMP_FILTER_FLAG_LOG` but\n  returns `SCMP_ACT_LOG` or `SCMP_ACT_KILL*`.\n\nCheck the full documentation on https://inspektor-gadget.io/docs/latest/gadgets/audit_seccomp","readmeBase":"https://inspektor-gadget.io/docs/latest/gadgets/audit_seccomp","publisher":{"name":"Inspektor Gadget","url":"https://artifacthub.io/packages/search?org=inspektor-gadget","official":false,"verified":true,"cncf":false},"registered":null,"updated":"2026-09-07T14:16:59.000Z","categories":["Monitoring and logging"],"keywords":["gadget"],"license":null,"links":[{"name":"home","url":"https://inspektor-gadget.io/docs/latest/gadgets/audit_seccomp"},{"name":"source","url":"https://github.com/inspektor-gadget/inspektor-gadget/tree/main/gadgets/audit_seccomp"},{"name":"Official gadgets repository","url":"https://github.com/inspektor-gadget/inspektor-gadget/"}],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":null,"stars":0,"subscriptions":0},"mediaTypes":[],"contentTypes":[],"storage":null,"tags":[{"name":"0.56.0","digest":"sha256:2026-09-07T14:16:59Z","pushed":"2026-09-07T14:16:59.000Z","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":null,"status":null,"appVersion"